    ],
    [
      "P006",
      "Inhomogeneous Field - An electric field which does not have a constant voltage gradient between\nelectrodes.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P007",
      "7.1.6 Overvoltage Withstand Test",
      false,
      "heading",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P008",
      "Overvoltage Withstand Test (layer test) - Test intended to verify the power-frequency withstand\nstrength along the winding under test and between its phase (strength between turns and between\nlayers in the windings).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P009",
      "7.3\nSpecific\nThe following terms are specifically defined for the purposes of Part 4, Chapter 8.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P010",
      "7.3.1 Low Voltage",
      false,
      "heading",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P011",
      "Low voltage in these Rules refers to voltages up to and including 1000 V AC; and 1500 V DC.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P012",
      "7.3.2 High Voltage",
      false,
      "heading",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S003"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P013",
      "High voltage in these Rules refers to voltages above 1000 V up to and including 15 kV AC.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "7.3.3 Essential Services",
      false,
      "heading",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P015",
      "Essential services are those considered necessary for:\n● Continuous operation to maintain propulsion and steering (primary essential services);\n● Non-continuous operation to maintain propulsion and steering and a minimum level of safety\nfor the vessel’s navigation and systems including safety for dangerous cargoes to be carried\n(secondary essential services); and\n● Emergency services as described in 4-8-2/5.5; (each service is either primary essential or\nsecondary essential depending upon its nature).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P016",
      "Examples of primary essential services and secondary essential services are as listed in 4-8-1/7.3.3\nTABLE 1 and 4-8-1/7.3.3 TABLE 2, respectively.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P017",
      "TABLE 1",
      false,
      "heading",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P018",
      "Primary Essential Services (2021)\n(a)\nSteering gears\n(b)\nPumps for controllable pitch propellers\n(c)\nScavenging air blower, fuel oil supply pumps, fuel valve cooling pumps, lubricating oil pumps and\ncooling water pumps for main and auxiliary engines, turbines and shafting necessary for propulsion\n(d)\nVentilation necessary to maintain propulsion\n(e)\nForced draft fans, feed water pumps, water circulating pumps, vacuum pumps and condensate pumps\nfor steam plants on steam turbine ships, and also for auxiliary boilers on vessels where steam is used\nfor equipment supplying primary essential services\n(f)\nOil burning installations for steam plants on steam turbine vessels and for auxiliary boilers where\nsteam is used for equipment supplying primary essential services\n(g)\nFuel gas supply pumps, low duty gas compressor and other boil-off gas treatment facilities supporting\nboil-off gas usage as fuel to main propulsion or electric power generation machinery.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005",
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P019",
      "(h)\nAzimuth thrusters which are the sole means for propulsion/steering with lubricating oil pumps,\ncooling water pumps, etc.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005",
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P020",
      "(i)\nElectrical equipment for electric propulsion plant with lubricating oil pumps and cooling water\npumps",
      false,
      "prose",
      "735:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005",
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
